window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Sammy O'Connor didn't mean to steal a dragon's necklace...she just kind of did.</p> <p>Little did she know that the viciously hot and muscled Rax Janvier would come to claim it and her, willing to do anything to get it back. It's a fragment of a key that opens up a lock to his past—and hers.</p> <p>Can she survive being kidnapped by a sea dragon who's obsessed with her? And what happens if she starts to want him back?</p> <p>This story features a sea dragon shifter, an orca shifter, and a telepathic octopus sidekick!</p>"; 
